{"product_id":"fabjob-guide-to-become-a-bridal-salon-owner-with-cdrom-fabjob-guides","title":"FabJob Guide to Become a Bridal Salon Owner [With CDROM] (FabJob Guides)","description":"\u003cp\u003eImagine having a rewaqrding career as the owner of a bridal salon, getting paid to help women find the wedding gown of their dreams. In the FabJob Guide to Become a Bridal Salon Owner you will discover: - How to start a bridal salon, including how to prepare a business plan and get start-up funding - How to increase your profits by outfitting the entire wedding party, selling accessories from garters to guest books, or offering prom and party dresses - How to find suppliers of gowns and accessories plus ways to save money on your merchandise - How to attract brides-to be and other customers, with tips on choosing the best location and effective marketing techniques including how to get referrals. If you want to open a bridal salon, bridal boutique, or bridal shop, this FabJob Guide to Become a Bridal Salon Owner is for you\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:0 x 0  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Alisa Gordaneer \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781897286951 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 242\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44786652479641,"sku":"5RD9781897286951","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/8c37b9ed462a3ddc0701fe0cfc929357.jpg?v=1724837608","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/fabjob-guide-to-become-a-bridal-salon-owner-with-cdrom-fabjob-guides","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}